#namecost("WAND OF WHIMSY", "30 points")
#para(((emph: "", text: "Staff. Whenever the bearer successfully casts or dispels a spell, roll a D6 – the Wand of Whimsy gains a charge token on a roll of 5+. The Wand of Whimsy grants the bearer a bonus to both Strength and Attacks equal to the number of charge tokens for the remainder of the game."),))
#namecost("THE CHROMATIC TOME", "10 points")
#para(((emph: "", text: "Relic. You can choose to re-roll the Winds of Magic dice in your turn. However, if you do so, your opponent can also re-roll the Winds of Magic dice in their next turn if they wish. In either case, all of the Winds of Magic dice must be re-rolled."),))

